#: data/io.github.Foldex.AdwSteamGtk.appdata.xml.in:12
#: data/io.github.Foldex.AdwSteamGtk.desktop.in:3
msgid "AdwSteamGtk"
msgstr "AdwSteamGtk"

#: data/io.github.Foldex.AdwSteamGtk.appdata.xml.in:13
msgid "Give Steam the Adwaita treatment"
msgstr "Giv Steam Adwaita-behandlingen"

#: data/io.github.Foldex.AdwSteamGtk.appdata.xml.in:14
#: data/io.github.Foldex.AdwSteamGtk.appdata.xml.in:16
msgid "Foldex"
msgstr "Foldex"

#: data/io.github.Foldex.AdwSteamGtk.appdata.xml.in:25
msgid ""
"Make Steam look like it belongs on your computer. This app installs and "
"updates the Adwaita-for-Steam skin for you. It's as simple as this:"
msgstr ""
"Få Steam til at ligne, at det passer på din computer. Denne app installerer "
"og opdaterer \"Adwaita-for-steam\" temaet for dig. Det er så simpelt som "
"dette:"

#: data/io.github.Foldex.AdwSteamGtk.appdata.xml.in:30
msgid "Configure the skin to your liking"
msgstr "Indstil temaet efter din smag"

#: data/io.github.Foldex.AdwSteamGtk.appdata.xml.in:31
msgid "Click the “Apply” button"
msgstr "Tryk på \"Anvend\" knappen"

#: data/io.github.Foldex.AdwSteamGtk.appdata.xml.in:32
msgid "Restart Steam"
msgstr "Genstart Steam"

#: data/io.github.Foldex.AdwSteamGtk.appdata.xml.in:34
msgid ""
"On startup, the app will automatically download any updates to the skin and "
"display a notification. Apply the skin again and restart Steam to take the "
"changes into use."
msgstr ""
"Ved opstart vil appen automatisk downloade alle opdateringer til temaet, og "
"vise en notifikation. Anvend temaet igen og genstart Steam for at tage "
"ændringerne i brug."

#: data/io.github.Foldex.AdwSteamGtk.appdata.xml.in:38
msgid ""
"In order to get rounded corners on Steam, you will need to use the “Rounded "
"Window Corners” GNOME extension."
msgstr ""
"For at få afrundede hjørner på Steam, bliver du nødt til at anvende "
"\"Rounded Window Corners\" GNOME-udvidelsen."

#: data/io.github.Foldex.AdwSteamGtk.appdata.xml.in:244
msgid "Main Window"
msgstr "Hovedvindue"

#: data/io.github.Foldex.AdwSteamGtk.appdata.xml.in:248
msgid "Theme Preview"
msgstr "Tema forhåndsvisning"

#: data/io.github.Foldex.AdwSteamGtk.appdata.xml.in:252
msgid "Login Preview"
msgstr "Log-ind forhåndsvisning"

#: data/io.github.Foldex.AdwSteamGtk.desktop.in:4
msgid "A simple wrapper that installs Adwaita for Steam"
msgstr "En simpel wrapper, der installerer Adwaita til Steam"

#: data/io.github.Foldex.AdwSteamGtk.desktop.in:10
msgid "Steam;Adwaita;Skin;"
msgstr "Steam;Adwaita;Tema;"

